  **Acceptance criteria:**
  - A Monday run sends one email listing every item at or below its reorder point, without reading payment data.
  **Executor:** GitHub Actions
  **Diagram:**
  ```flowchart
  flowchart TB
    P["GitHub Actions"] -->|Run weekly restock alert| T1["Northwind Order Service and store mail service"]
